1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,628
You'd never guess what made this call.

2
00:00:01,648 --> 00:00:06,848
[NOAA recording]

3
00:00:07,233 --> 00:00:10,748
One whale, fifty-two hertz, tracked for twelve years.

4
00:00:10,768 --> 00:00:12,625
What kind of whale is it, actually?

5
00:00:12,645 --> 00:00:15,141
Blue and fin whales call much lower. And each

6
00:00:15,161 --> 00:00:17,955
season, only one voice like this was found.

7
00:00:17,975 --> 00:00:20,313
Scientists suggested a malformation, or a

8
00:00:20,333 --> 00:00:22,176
hybrid. Nobody has confirmed it.

9
00:00:22,196 --> 00:00:23,341
Still unknown.

10
00:00:23,361 --> 00:00:25,436
Five more ocean sounds are on the channel.
